{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017qDAUbFC1SSi51mVWjnfCs","type":"tool_result","content":"190\t\n191\tThe whole thing at once, then, with a few controls plotted on both.\n192\t\n193\t<!-- FIGURE: ch12-fig01-4cs-and-lifecycle-phases -->\n194\t```\n195\t   THE PHASES — when a control acts\n196\t   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n197\t\n198\t   DEVELOP  ────▶  DISTRIBUTE  ────▶  DEPLOY  ────▶  RUNTIME\n199\t                                                       │\n200\t                                          ┌────────────┼────────────┐\n201\t                                          │            │            │\n202\t                                        ACCESS      COMPUTE      STORAGE\n203\t\n204\t\n205\t   THE LAYERS — where a control acts\n206\t   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n207\t\n208\t   ┌─ CLOUD ──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n209\t   │  ┌─ CLUSTER ─────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n210\t   │  │  ┌─ CONTAINER ────────────────────────────┐   │   │\n211\t   │  │  │  ┌─ CODE ──────────────────────────┐   │   │   │\n212\t   │  │  │  │                                 │   │   │   │\n213\t   │  │  │  └─────────────────────────────────┘   │   │   │\n214\t   │  │  └────────────────────────────────────────┘   │   │\n215\t   │  └───────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │\n216\t   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n217\t\n218\t\n219\t   FIVE CONTROLS, PLOTTED ON BOTH\n220\t   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n221\t\n222\t   control                    phase                layer\n223\t   ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n224\t   RBAC                       runtime / access     Cluster\n225\t   ServiceAccount             runtime / access     Cluster\n226\t   securityContext            runtime / compute    Container\n227\t   encryption at rest         runtime / storage    Cloud → Cluster\n228\t   image signing              distribute           Container\n229\t```\n230\t\n231\tDo not try to hold twelve controls on this map yet. Hold the *shape*: four phases in sequence, four layers nested, and the runtime phase split three ways. The sections that follow fill it in.\n232\t\n233\t---\n234\t\n235\t## ⚪ §2 — Who You Are\n236\t\n237\tEvery request that reaches the Kubernetes API arrives claiming to be somebody. This section is about who that somebody can be, and, as importantly, about what that claim is *not*.\n238\t\n239\t### The object"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e7de6482-238e-46bc-bfd1-6b5d0d0774fe","uuid":"88aa9d6d-2934-4687-81f4-e5747f5489c3","timestamp":"2026-08-31T05:23:49.085Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\lodestar\\Book-KCNA\\.pipeline-state\\ch-12\\draft-v1.md","content":"\nThe whole thing at once, then, with a few controls plotted on both.\n\n<!-- FIGURE: ch12-fig01-4cs-and-lifecycle-phases -->\n```\n   THE PHASES — when a control acts\n   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n   DEVELOP  ────▶  DISTRIBUTE  ────▶  DEPLOY  ────▶  RUNTIME\n                                                       │\n                                          ┌────────────┼────────────┐\n                                          │            │            │\n                                        ACCESS      COMPUTE      STORAGE\n\n\n   THE LAYERS — where a control acts\n   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n   ┌─ CLOUD ──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   │  ┌─ CLUSTER ─────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n   │  │  ┌─ CONTAINER ────────────────────────────┐   │   │\n   │  │  │  ┌─ CODE ──────────────────────────┐   │   │   │\n   │  │  │  │                                 │   │   │   │\n   │  │  │  └─────────────────────────────────┘   │   │   │\n   │  │  └────────────────────────────────────────┘   │   │\n   │  └───────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │\n   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n\n   FIVE CONTROLS, PLOTTED ON BOTH\n   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n   control                    phase                layer\n   ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n   RBAC                       runtime / access     Cluster\n   ServiceAccount             runtime / access     Cluster\n   securityContext            runtime / compute    Container\n   encryption at rest         runtime / storage    Cloud → Cluster\n   image signing              distribute           Container\n```\n\nDo not try to hold twelve controls on this map yet. Hold the *shape*: four phases in sequence, four layers nested, and the runtime phase split three ways. The sections that follow fill it in.\n\n---\n\n## ⚪ §2 — Who You Are\n\nEvery request that reaches the Kubernetes API arrives claiming to be somebody. This section is about who that somebody can be, and, as importantly, about what that claim is *not*.\n\n### The object","numLines":50,"startLine":190,"totalLines":1764}}}
