{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011D8h2qfzV2JNWRihXLFqMc","type":"tool_result","content":"1063\t<!-- FIGURE: ch12-fig05-supply-chain-checkpoints -->\n1064\t```\n1065\t   OUTSIDE THE CLUSTER                              │   INSIDE\n1066\t   ═════════════════════════════════════════════════╪═══════════\n1067\t                                                    │\n1068\t   BUILD ──▶ SCAN ──▶ SIGN ──▶ RECORD ──▶ RESTRICT ─┼─▶ VERIFY ──▶ RUN\n1069\t     │         │        │         │          │      │      │\n1070\t     │         │        │         │          │      │      │\n1071\t     ▼         ▼        ▼         ▼          ▼      │      ▼\n1072\t   image     known    binds     append-    private  │   admission\n1073\t   +digest   CVEs     to the    only log   registry │   controller\n1074\t   +SBOM              DIGEST                        │\n1075\t                        ▲                           │   ▲\n1076\t     ┌──────────────────┴─────────────┐             │   │\n1077\t     │  the artifact's identity —     │             │   │\n1078\t     │  the same digest — is carried  │             │   │\n1079\t     │  the whole length of the chain │             │   │\n1080\t     └────────────────────────────────┘             │   │\n1081\t                                                    │   │\n1082\t   Trivy, Harbor    Cosign     Rekor    Harbor,     │  Kyverno,\n1083\t   scanners         Notation            imagePull-  │  Gatekeeper,\n1084\t                    Fulcio              Secrets     │  Policy\n1085\t                                                    │  Controller\n1086\t                                                    │\n1087\t   ◀── everything left of the line happened somewhere else,\n1088\t       under somebody else's control, possibly months ago.\n1089\t       VERIFY is the first checkpoint the cluster performs itself.\n1090\t```\n1091\t\n1092\tThat vertical line is the point of the figure. Every step but one happ